      "published": "Tue, 25 Aug 2026 10:58:17 +0000",
      "summary_raw": "<p>From fitting headlines to complete page building, publishers are testing where automation can reduce production work without taking editorial judgment away from the newsroom.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org/2026/08/what-happens-when-ai-starts-building-the-newspaper-page/\">What happens when AI starts building the newspaper page?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org\">WAN-IFRA</a>.</p>",
