      "title": "How Spain’s SPORT is exploring AI for its digital newsroom",
      "link": "https://wan-ifra.org/2026/08/how-spains-sport-is-exploring-ai-for-its-digital-newsroom/",
      "published": "Tue, 25 Aug 2026 07:55:53 +0000",
      "summary_raw": "<p>The Spanish media outlet’s MENTOR project is looking at how AI can support journalists with tasks including content review, headline suggestions, summaries, transcription, translation and archive searches, while keeping editorial decisions with the newsroom.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org/2026/08/how-spains-sport-is-exploring-ai-for-its-digital-newsroom/\">How Spain’s SPORT is exploring AI for its digital newsroom</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org\">WAN-IFRA</a>.</p>",
      "source": "WAN-IFRA"
    },
